{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you will simulate a chicken living on a farm in third person or first person, where you can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with animal friends, feed them fruits, get wet, swim, swing on swings, unlock skins, play basketball, prank, annoy NPCs, peck, throw things, even destroy farms, and more ..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/ChickenPV_2.gif?t=1751588542\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/ChickenPV.gif?t=1751588542\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The animals you have fed will follow the direction of your call, and a little mouse will become your good companion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game currently includes three skins that need to be discovered in the game to unlock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/Knight.png?t=1751588542\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/ikun.png?t=1751588542\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/Baby.png?t=1751588542\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are also some game Easter eggs and cheesy jokes on the farm, and each time you approach an NPC, there may be new dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/ChickenPV_4.gif?t=1751588542\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aside from aimlessly wandering around, you can also:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accept farm tasks, complete farm stories about friendship, love, and family among the people on the farm, and experience healing moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/ChickenPV_1.gif?t=1751588542\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete all tasks to pass the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become the beloved chicken on the farm and win the embrace and praise of farmers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After completing all tasks, play the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But be careful:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some tasks require completing prerequisites first, and after annoying NPCs, some will continue to dislike you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you annoy too many NPCs, they will kick you out, and you'll never be able to return to the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/\u5584\u6076\u6761.png?t=1751588542\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When it rains, bad guy will attack you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/91686dc8a76db308cdf23cffa0a7a840.avif?t=1751588542\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Farm resources are limited and cannot be restored after being destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use boxes to transport fruits and improve efficiency... but don't get trapped under the boxes! If you do this, then struggle wildly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/ChickenPV_3.gif?t=1751588542\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3721350?t=1751588542","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/d9c57213b0a301c52813b92426a2854c807148be/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751588542","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/e80ec8d9650874f834bdf311c38eb98e7d8bfd02/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751588542","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/e80ec8d9650874f834bdf311c38eb98e7d8bfd02/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751588542","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3729010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you will simulate a chicken living on a farm in third person or first person, where you can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with animal friends, feed them fruits, get wet, swim, swing on swings, unlock skins, play basketball, prank, annoy NPCs, peck, throw things, even destroy farms, and more ..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/ChickenPV_2.gif?t=1751588542\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/ChickenPV.gif?t=1751588542\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The animals you have fed will follow the direction of your call, and a little mouse will become your good companion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game currently includes three skins that need to be discovered in the game to unlock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/Knight.png?t=1751588542\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/ikun.png?t=1751588542\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/Baby.png?t=1751588542\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are also some game Easter eggs and cheesy jokes on the farm, and each time you approach an NPC, there may be new dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/ChickenPV_4.gif?t=1751588542\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aside from aimlessly wandering around, you can also:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accept farm tasks, complete farm stories about friendship, love, and family among the people on the farm, and experience healing moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/ChickenPV_1.gif?t=1751588542\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete all tasks to pass the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become the beloved chicken on the farm and win the embrace and praise of farmers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After completing all tasks, play the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But be careful:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some tasks require completing prerequisites first, and after annoying NPCs, some will continue to dislike you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you annoy too many NPCs, they will kick you out, and you'll never be able to return to the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\